        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Docs: Clarify <progress> element attributes]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41443</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41443"/>
        <updated>2025-10-09T01:38:20.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106546046?u=974a8ef7bb910b04d65960b8dd22ea41815111cd&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Clarify the  element attributes, delete the <code class="notranslate">min</code> attribute which is not allowed for the  element.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">In the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/progress" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">&lt;progress&gt;</code></a> MDN Web, have this note:</p>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-note" dir="auto"><p class="markdown-alert-title" dir="auto"><svg class="octicon octicon-info mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir="auto">Note: Unlike the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/meter" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">&lt;meter&gt;</code></a> element, the minimum value is always 0, and the min attribute is not allowed for the &lt;progress&gt; element.</p>
</div>
<p dir="auto">so I delete the <code class="notranslate">min</code> attribute in <code class="notranslate">&lt;progress&gt;</code> and the description in these pages.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/progress" rel="nofollow">&lt;progress&gt; - HTML | MDN</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>]]></content>
